COMPILE ~CotSC/better_immersion_beregost/friendly_arm_inn.d~ USING ~CotSC/translation/%LANGUAGE%/better_immersion_beregost/friendly_arm_inn.tra~
COMPILE ~CotSC/better_immersion_beregost/bg2300_friendly_arm.baf~
EXTEND_TOP ~BG2300.BCS~ ~CotSC/better_immersion_beregost/bg2300_friendly_arm.baf~
